  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Work a small ball shape from a "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-knob"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ". Expand to the knob diameter, then rise straight for the knob depth, then decrease with "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-knob"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to close around the back of the knob."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Use a DK yarn with some elasticity to allow the cover to stretch over the knob. Total yarn around 20 m."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "What you need"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "suppliesCard",
        "attrs": {
          "heading": "Materials",
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "DK yarn (with stretch)",
              "qty": "20 m"
            },
            {
              "name": "4 mm crochet hook",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Tapestry needle",
              "qty": "1"
            },
            {
              "name": "Scissors",
              "qty": "1 pair"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Cover"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Round 1: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "magic-ring-knob"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "magic ring"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", 6 dc. Rounds 2 to 4: increase to 18 dc. Rounds 5 to 7: dc even. Rounds 8 to 10: "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "dc2tog-knob"
                }
              }
            ],
            "text": "dc2tog"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " reduce to 9 dc. Pull yarn through last sts, pull tight."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Fitting"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Stretch the cover over the doorknob from the front. The elastic DC will grip the knob without a fastening."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
